  "notes": "USAGE:\n{養蜂|ようほう} is the standard term for beekeeping. It can also function as a する verb ({養蜂|ようほう}する).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {養蜂|ようほう}{家|か} (beekeeper)\n- {養蜂|ようほう}{場|じょう} (apiary; bee farm)\n- {養蜂|ようほう}{箱|ばこ} (beehive box)\n\nWORD FORMATION:\n{養|よう} (to raise/keep) + {蜂|ほう} (bee). The same {養|よう} appears in {養殖|ようしょく} (aquaculture) and {養鶏|ようけい} (poultry farming).",
